# VHS Demo Script for Goja JavaScript REPL - Part 1: Basic Features (Simplified)

# Output file
Output demos/demo_part1_simple.gif

# Terminal settings
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set TypingSpeed 50ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

# Start the REPL
Type "cd ~/goja-repl && ./repl"
Enter
Sleep 3s

# Basic JavaScript evaluation
Type "2 + 2"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1s

# Demonstrate code wrapping with a shorter string
Type "const msg = 'This string demonstrates code wrapping in the REPL UI'"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

# Exit the REPL
Type "/quit"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
